OL,3,GNEWSAEvicted hotel guest jailed for
OL,4,Asetting fire to room
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who put up to 170 people in a
OL,7,Fhotel in danger by setting his room on
OL,8,Ffire has been jailed for more than two
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FMohammed Abdalla started the fire at
OL,12,Fthe Bradford Hotel on Hall Ings on the
OL,13,Fday he was due to be evicted from the
OL,14,Fpremises due to his behaviour, Bradford
OL,15,FCrown Court heard.
OL,17,FUp to 160 guests and 10 staff were
OL,18,Finside the five-storey building on 31
OL,19,FOctober 2025 when the blaze broke out.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
